<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport" />
    <title>Zen-Zen Snack Haus</title>

    <link href="{{base_url}}public/style/style.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
  </head>
  <body>
    {% include 'components/header.twig' %}
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="kicker"> Your neighborhood cup, made better. </span>
          <h1>
            Slow mornings.
            <br />
            <em> Great coffee. </em>
          </h1>
          <p>
            Thoughtfully sourced beans, comforting bakes, and handcrafted
            drinks—made fresh for your everyday rituals.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="primary" href="/products"> Explore our menu → </a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/#about"> Our story </a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-trust">
            <span>
              <i> </i>
              <span>
                <b> 15 min </b>
                average pickup
              </span>
              <i> </i>
              <span>
                <b> Fresh </b>
                daily
              </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img
            alt="Cappuccino"
            src="{{base_url}}public/images/designs/6312341292549084530.jpg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    {# <section class="section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <span class="kicker"> Find your favorite </span>
          <h2>What are you craving?</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/products"> View full menu → </a>
      </div>
      <div class="category-grid">
        <a class="category-card" href="/products">
          <span class="cat-icon"> ○ </span>
          <span>
            <b> Coffee </b>
            <small> Freshly pulled </small>
          </span>
          ›
        </a>
        <a class="category-card" href="/products">
          <span class="cat-icon"> ○ </span>
          <span>
            <b> Non-Coffee </b>
            <small> Smooth &amp; cozy </small>
          </span>
          ›
        </a>
        <a class="category-card" href="/products">
          <span class="cat-icon"> ○ </span>
          <span>
            <b> Tea </b>
            <small> Calm in a cup </small>
          </span>
          ›
        </a>
        <a class="category-card" href="/products">
          <span class="cat-icon"> ◇ </span>
          <span>
            <b> Pastries </b>
            <small> Baked this morning </small>
          </span>
          ›
        </a>
      </div>
    </section> #}
    <section class="section best-sellers-section" id="menu">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <span class="kicker"> Made with care </span>
          <h2>Our top 3 best sellers</h2>
          <p>Our most-ordered snacks and refreshments, based on completed orders.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="outline" href="/products"> Browse all </a>
      </div>
      <div class="product-grid best-sellers-grid">
        {% for product in products %}
          {% include 'components/product-card.twig' %}
        {% else %}
          <p class="catalog-empty">Our best sellers are on the way. <a class="text-link" href="/products">Explore the full menu →</a></p>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="story" id="about">
      <div class="story-image">
        <img
          alt="Fresh coffee"
          src="{{base_url}}public/images/designs/6312341292549084533.jpg"
        />
        <span class="story-stamp">
          ROASTED
          <br />
          WITH CARE
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <span class="kicker"> A little about us </span>
        <h2>
          Good coffee brings
          <br />
          good people together.
        </h2>
        <p>
        Zen-Zen Snack Haus started by selling fruit soda. As time went by, customers requested that we add more 
        products to our menu. We also got ideas from videos we watched on Facebook. Whenever we tried a new recipe 
        and liked its taste, we added it to our menu. Our only son also requested that we include a Milo Series 
        because it was something he wanted to have in our shop. We decided to add it to the menu, and our customers 
        enjoyed it as well. As a result, our food and drink selections continued to grow, giving our customers more choices.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="visit" id="visit">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker"> Come say hello </span>
        <h2>Your corner for coffee &amp; calm.</h2>
        <p>Open daily · 7:00 AM – 9:00 PM</p>
      </div>
      <div class="visit-details">
        <div>
          <small> FIND US </small>
          <b> Brgy. Ambassador Alzate Village, Nampicuan, Nueva Ecija </b>
        </div>
        <div>
          <small> CALL AHEAD </small>
          <b> 0953 429 5847 </b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    {% include 'components/footer.twig' %}
    <script type="module" src="{{base_url}}public/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
